{
  "version": "phase_08b_automation_policy-v1",
  "purpose": "Declarative Phase 08B automation/observability policy substrate: health-check, retry, weekend, and alerting posture plus the structured reason-code vocabulary the future automation-hardening evaluator consumes. Declarative only \u2014 this prompt ships the policy + reason codes, not the execution.",
